15
00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:48.841
Well. that's not very friendly. is it?

16
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:50.801
Aren't you gonna say hello first?

17
00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.302
Where's Anna?

18
00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:53.470
Wow.

19
00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.224
It's so weird to see you here.

20
00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.103
I remember when you used to take walks
along the river

21
