47
00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:10.172
Oh. shit.

48
00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.841
You got shot in the gut.

49
00:02:13.425 --> 00:02:17.054
You need help right away.
but out here. you're fucked.

50
00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:20.307
