you hear me?

80
00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.418
Don't you do it. you motherfucker!
Don't you do it!

81
00:04:11.502 --> 00:04:13.795
Enough is enough. here!
Let me out of here!

82
00:04:15.297 --> 00:04:19.843
